subject: Your Detag subscription will be canceled soon — update your payment method

--- text ---
Hi,

Your Detag pro plan payment failed 7 days ago, and your subscription is still past due. Your plan's paid limits stay paused until the payment succeeds.

Update your payment method at http://localhost:8080/billing — if the payment keeps failing, your subscription will be canceled.

— The Detag team

